WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.670
The Helix Nebula, as a telescope sees it.

00:03.413 --> 00:06.093
This photograph from Chile lines up with our sky.

00:06.601 --> 00:08.991
At its centre a star like the Sun is dying.

00:09.577 --> 00:15.934
Gaia, a spacecraft, measured its yearly shift: it is 655 light-years away.
